{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01BartsKnNgqc1kCivC8PJFE", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.tmtpost.com/4896592.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ourchinastory.com/cn/amp/12951\"}, {\"url\": \"https://m.huxiu.com/article/400536.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ourchinastory.com/cn/12951\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.court.gov.cn/xinshidai/xiangqing/280111.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://language.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202012/17/WS5fdb1e10a31024ad0ba9c736.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ncsti.gov.cn/kjdt/ztbd/jjhtkjzwftmx/kjjz/202203/t20220328_64121.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.cn-healthcare.com/articlewm/20201218/content-1173181.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zzwb.zynews.cn/page/2/2020-12/18/A15/20201218A15_pdf.pdf\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:47:21.811Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "嫦娥五号返回器 2020年12月17日 着陆场", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_014rEKr6cmLYwrctoyFDK6p3", "content": [{"title": "www.tmtpost.com", "url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/4896592.html"}, {"title": "嫦娥五号“揽月归来” 顺利返抵地球", "url": "https://www.ourchinastory.com/cn/amp/12951"}, {"title": "2020-12-17 09:29", "url": "https://m.huxiu.com/article/400536.html"}, {"title": "嫦娥五号“揽月归来” 顺利返抵地球", "url": "https://www.ourchinastory.com/cn/12951"}, {"title": "所在位置: 首页 > 学习新时代", "url": "https://www.court.gov.cn/xinshidai/xiangqing/280111.html"}, {"title": "首页  | 每日一词", "url": "https://language.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202012/17/WS5fdb1e10a31024ad0ba9c736.html"}, {"title": "t20220328 64121", "url": "https://www.ncsti.gov.cn/kjdt/ztbd/jjhtkjzwftmx/kjjz/202203/t20220328_64121.html"}, {"title": "content 1173181", "url": "https://www.cn-healthcare.com/articlewm/20201218/content-1173181.html"}, {"title": "20201218A15 pdf", "url": "https://zzwb.zynews.cn/page/2/2020-12/18/A15/20201218A15_pdf.pdf"}]}, "搜索结果显示，嫦娥五号返回器于2020年12月17日凌晨在内蒙古四子王旗着陆场着陆，结束了我国首次月球采样返回任务。\n\n- **时间与地点**：新华网报道称，12月17日1时59分，嫦娥五号返回器携带月球样品在内蒙古四子王旗预定区域安全着陆。\n- **任务时长与样品**：据腾讯太空的报道，返回器在太空飞行约23天后着陆，带回约2千克月壤。\n- **搜救情况**：陆空搜索队在不足半小时内便找到返回器。另有报道指出，返回器体积仅为神舟飞船返回舱的七分之一，但落区面积是后者的16倍，加上高寒冰雪环境，搜寻难度较大。\n- **选址原因**：四子王旗地势平坦开阔、人烟稀少、气候干燥少雨，此前神舟系列飞船也在此着陆，因而适合作为着陆场。\n- **后续处理**：返回器需先完成地面处理，再空运至北京开舱，取出样品容器和搭载物。\n\n注意：各报道对时间的表述略有差异（如\"凌晨2点左右\"与\"1时59分\"），但多数来源以新华网的1时59分为准。"], "durationSeconds": 6.706370625, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01BartsKnNgqc1kCivC8PJFE", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
